     "type": "question",
     "label": null,
     "prompt": "State the domain and range of $y=\\sqrt{x-2}+1$.",
     "answer": {
      "short": "Domain: $x\\geq2$.\n\nRange: $y\\geq1$.",
      "worked": "The expression under the square root must be non-negative, so $x-2\\geq0$ and $x\\geq2$.\n\nSince $\\sqrt{x-2}\\geq0$, we have $y\\geq1$."
     }
