     "label": null,
     "prompt": "Determine whether $f(x)=x^3-2x$ is even, odd or neither.",
     "answer": {
      "short": "Odd, since $f(-x)=-f(x)$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}f(-x)&=(-x)^3-2(-x)\\\\&=-x^3+2x\\\\&=-(x^3-2x)\\\\&=-f(x)\\end{align*}$$\nSo $f$ is odd."
     },
